}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-25828", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Head elevation–To decrease the hydrostatic pressure and thereby the edema. No data are documenting the effectiveness of this maneuver, but it is simple and without risk.", "runs": [{"text": "Head"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "elevation–To"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "decrease"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hydrostatic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pressure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thereby"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "edema."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "No"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "data"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "documenting"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the effectiveness of this maneuver, but it is simple and without risk."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "387"}}, {"id": "body-25829", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Glucocorticoid therapy (dexamethasone, 4 mg every 6 hours) to relieve inflammation and oedema (to be avoided before biopsy if lymphoma is suspected as steroid induced tissue necrosis might obscure the diagnosis)", "runs": [{"text": "Glucocorticoid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "therapy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(dexamethasone,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "4"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "every"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "6"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hours)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "relieve"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "inflammation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oedema"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "avoided"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "before biopsy if lymphoma is suspected as steroid induced tissue necrosis might obscure the diagnosis)"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "387"}}, {"id": "body-25830", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Loop diuretics (furosemide) are also commonly used, but it is unclear whether venous pressure distal to the obstruction is affected by small changes in right atrial pressure.", "runs": [{"text": "Loop"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diuretics"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(furosemide)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "also"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "commonly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "but"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unclear"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "whether"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "venous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pressure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "distal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "obstruction is affected by small changes in right atrial pressure."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "387"}}, {"id": "body-25832", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Definitive Therapy", "runs": [{"text": "Definitive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Therapy"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-25833", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Radiation treatment to the malignant mass.", "runs": [{"text": "Radiation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "malignant"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mass."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "387"}}, {"id": "body-25834", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Chemotherapy–in chemo sensitive cancers like lymphoma, germ cell tumours or small cell lung cancer", "runs": [{"text": "Chemotherapy–in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "chemo"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sensitive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cancers"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "like"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lymphoma,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "germ"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cell"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tumours"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "small"}, {"t